        <mxCell id="z18" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Constraints &amp;amp; indexes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• follows: CHECK (follower_id &amp;lt;&amp;gt; following_id): no following yourself&lt;br&gt;• movie_nights.status: CHECK (status IN (&amp;#39;open&amp;#39;,&amp;#39;finalized&amp;#39;,&amp;#39;cancelled&amp;#39;))&lt;br&gt;• participants.status: CHECK (status IN (&amp;#39;pending&amp;#39;,&amp;#39;accepted&amp;#39;,&amp;#39;declined&amp;#39;))&lt;br&gt;• votes: one per user per movie night (primary key); candidate_id must belong to the same night (checked in the service)&lt;br&gt;• activities.event_id UNIQUE: the same event never creates two feed entries; user.blocked / user.unblocked hide and show a user&amp;#39;s activities&lt;br&gt;• Indexes: activities(user_id, created_at), follows(following_id), messages(room_id, created_at)"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1000" width="1240" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root>
